// Sungkyunkwan University, Humanities & Social Sciences Campus (성균관대 인문사회과학캠퍼스, 명륜). Data is generated by
// scripts/campuses/skku/build-package.mjs from the pilot (pilot/skku-myeongnyun): 15 destructible buildings (incl. the restored
// 교수회관), the 문묘·성균관 hanok (국가유산) as protected, never-damaged models, a baked ground with the pilot's ground shader
// (src/campuses/skku/ground-look.js) and the non-destructible context (명륜동 village, campus walls, 창덕궁·창경궁) that fades into the haze.
import { WORLD_UNITS_PER_METER, GEO_ORIGIN, SK_PLACEMENTS, SK_BUILDING_BASE, SK_HEIGHT_GRIDS, SK_HEIGHT_RANGE_M, SK_ENV_IDS, SK_ENV_MANIFEST_IDS, SK_LOOK, SK_ZONES, SK_PROVENANCE } from './data.js';
import { SK_FOOTPRINTS } from './footprints.js?v=tape41';
import { SK_HERITAGE } from './heritage.js';
import { createSkkuGroundLook } from './ground-look.js';

const MODEL_IDS = Object.freeze(SK_PLACEMENTS.map(p => p.id));
const asset = file => new URL(`../../../assets/campuses/skku/${file}`, import.meta.url).href;
const HAZE = '#d8e2e4';

export const SKKU = Object.freeze({
  id: 'skku',
  meta: Object.freeze({ school: '성균관대학교', campus: '인문사회과학캠퍼스(명륜)', short: '성균관대', modelNoun: '성균관대' }),
  geo: Object.freeze({ origin: GEO_ORIGIN, worldUnitsPerMeter: WORLD_UNITS_PER_METER }),
  placements: SK_PLACEMENTS,
  approvedCount: SK_PLACEMENTS.length,
  additionalCount: 0,
  coreIds: Object.freeze(['anniversary600', 'centralLibrary', 'business', 'facultyHall', 'hoam', 'suseon']),
  startBuildingId: 'business',
  // Start (startTurn candidates: reports/compare/skku-start-candidates.jpg): 600주년기념관 front over the plaza, 문묘 hanok on the
  // right, the 명륜동 village behind.
  // user 10-18: start on the 문묘 side looking up the slope at 경영관 (candidates F1-F8: 시안/img/성대_시작_문묘쪽_후보.jpg, chosen F7)
  // SKKU-only bag tool (user 10-18): the bowling-ball bomb rolls down the 명륜 slope (src/bowling-ball.js, src/demo-weapons.js CAMPUS_TOOLS).
  exclusiveTools: Object.freeze(['bowling']),
  view: Object.freeze({ startFrame: Object.freeze({ min: Object.freeze([-30, -12, -50]), max: Object.freeze([30, 10, 10]), azimuth: 0.67 }) }),
  models: Object.freeze({
    manifests: Object.freeze([
      Object.freeze({ url: asset('manifest.json'), expectedIds: MODEL_IDS }),
      Object.freeze({ url: asset('environment.json'), expectedIds: SK_ENV_MANIFEST_IDS }),
    ]),
    proceduralIds: Object.freeze([]),
    createProceduralSource: () => { throw new Error('No procedural buildings in this campus'); },
    enhanceFacade: () => ({ stats: {}, dispose() {} }),
  }),
  terrain: Object.freeze({ heightGrids: SK_HEIGHT_GRIDS, buildingBase: SK_BUILDING_BASE,
    source: 'Relative terrain estimate (SRTM + floor-link evidence, pilot/skku-myeongnyun); not a survey' }),
  environment: Object.freeze({ provenance: SK_PROVENANCE, sourceNote: 'OSM ground surfaces and surroundings (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL); village lots, heights, planting and the 문묘 hanok details estimated' }),
  ground: Object.freeze({
    baked: Object.freeze({ envIds: SK_ENV_IDS, castShadow: Object.freeze([]), materialHook: createSkkuGroundLook(SK_LOOK, SK_ZONES),
      fade: Object.freeze({ centre_m: Object.freeze([40, 40]), near_m: 650, far_m: 1250, colour: HAZE }), playMargin_m: 30,
      source: 'pilot/skku-myeongnyun preview ground + context, baked' }),
  }),
  // 서울 문묘와 성균관 (국가유산): never destructible; weapons meet the same protective shield as the hospitals elsewhere
  // (src/protected-buildings.js), loaded from their own small cache.
  protected: Object.freeze({
    manifestURL: asset('heritage/manifest.json'),
    models: SK_HERITAGE,
  }),
  // Hazard tape around every destructible building only (src/engine/hazard-tape.js): no tape on the hanok or the context.
  hazardTape: Object.freeze({ footprints: SK_FOOTPRINTS }),
  scene: Object.freeze({
    background: HAZE, fog: Object.freeze({ color: HAZE, near: 700, far: 2200 }),
    hemisphere: Object.freeze({ sky: '#eef2f4', ground: '#7d8a78', intensity: 1.3 }),
    sun: Object.freeze({ color: '#fff4e2', intensity: 2.9, position: Object.freeze([-100, 220, 120]), shadowSpan: 185 }),
    floor: Object.freeze({ color: '#c9cbc8', hidden: true, y: SK_HEIGHT_RANGE_M[0] * WORLD_UNITS_PER_METER - .3 }),
  }),
});
export default SKKU;
